--- a/wnba_v2/deployment/DEPLOYMENT_PLAN.md
+++ b/wnba_v2/deployment/DEPLOYMENT_PLAN.md
@@
+Current recommendation: controlled emergency staged serving of conserved V2 only.
+The old independent simulator is retired.
+Emergency serving requires simulation_version == "sim-5.4-conserved".
+Start at 5% traffic and cap emergency traffic at 10%.
--- a/wnba_v2/deployment/ROLLBACK_PLAN.md
+++ b/wnba_v2/deployment/ROLLBACK_PLAN.md
@@
+Rollback immediately if emergency_policy.allowed is false, simulation_version is not
+"sim-5.4-conserved", realism gates fail, learned calibration is missing, or V2
+Brier/combo Brier/ECE regresses worse than production.
